{"translation-revision-date":"2023-02-09 14:09+01:00","generator":"WP-CLI\/2.12.0","source":"js\/congress-a.js","domain":"messages","locale_data":{"messages":{"":{"domain":"messages","lang":"es","plural-forms":"nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);"},"Add slot":["A\u00f1adir franja"],"Add days and time slots. Each slot has time, title, speaker and room.":["A\u00f1ada d\u00edas y franjas horarias. Cada franja tiene hora, t\u00edtulo, ponente y sala."],"Add file":["A\u00f1adir archivo"],"Images":["Im\u00e1genes"],"An event app is the companion page your visitors open with their ticket: programme and schedule, speaker or artist info, venue maps, downloads, media and support pages \u2014 everything structured in one place. Perfect for a congress with multiple sessions, but just as much for a single event where ticket holders need extra info, a FAQ or contact options. Visitors do not need an account or an extra app: their ticket ID is the key, access opens with the ticket and can expire with it. Assign an event app to a product in the WooCommerce product settings \u2014 one app can serve multiple products, so an event series shares one app.":[""],"No icon":[""],"Open inline":["Abrir en l\u00ednea"],"Program":["Programa"],"Visitors first see a grid of page cards (icon\/image + description) instead of jumping straight into the first page.":[""],"Manual hard cutoff. Leave empty for unlimited access.":["L\u00edmite estricto manual. D\u00e9jelo vac\u00edo para acceso ilimitado."],"Active":["Activo"],"Short description (max 160)":[""],"Add section":["A\u00f1adir secci\u00f3n"],"Status":["Estado"],"Title and slug are required.":["El t\u00edtulo y el slug son obligatorios."],"Products":["Productos"],"Internal":["Interno"],"Current title:":["T\u00edtulo actual:"],"Cancel":["Cancelar"],"Shown in the wallet and email (e.g. \"Opera evening\", \"Zoo visit\"). Empty = use the global default.":[""],"Remove":["Eliminar"],"Speakers":[""],"Add page":["A\u00f1adir p\u00e1gina"],"Delete section?":["\u00bfEliminar secci\u00f3n?"],"Choose video":["Elegir v\u00eddeo"],"Custom width":["Ancho personalizado"],"No sections on this page yet.":["Todav\u00eda no hay secciones en esta p\u00e1gina."],"Title for new edition (leave empty to auto-generate):":["T\u00edtulo para nueva edici\u00f3n (dejar vac\u00edo para auto-generar):"],"Icon, optional image, card color and a short description shown on the page card.":[""],"Rename":["Renombrar"],"Choose":["Elegir"],"Add":[""],"Video":["V\u00eddeo"],"Choose which page this section belongs to. Change it to move the section to another page.":["Elija a qu\u00e9 p\u00e1gina pertenece esta secci\u00f3n. C\u00e1mbielo para mover la secci\u00f3n a otra p\u00e1gina."],"Delete page?":["\u00bfEliminar la p\u00e1gina?"],"Details":["Detalles"],"Files":["Archivos"],"Drag to reorder pages":["Arrastre para reordenar las p\u00e1ginas"],"Page card settings":[""],"Delete":["Eliminar"],"Video URL":["URL del v\u00eddeo"],"Add URL":["A\u00f1adir URL"],"Link (YouTube, Vimeo, \u2026)":["Enlace (YouTube, Vimeo, \u2026)"],"Display size":["Tama\u00f1o de visualizaci\u00f3n"],"start page":["p\u00e1gina de inicio"],"Short bio (max 500 characters)":[""],"Portal label":[""],"Edit section":["Editar secci\u00f3n"],"Image":["Imagen"],"Show pages as a card grid on the start screen":[""],"Edit event app":[""],"Icon":[""],"Save congress":["Guardar congreso"],"Assign via the WooCommerce product settings.":["Asignar en la configuraci\u00f3n del producto WooCommerce."],"Name":["Nombre"],"Unique identifier for this congress. Visitors open it through their personal ticket link, not the slug.":["Identificador \u00fanico de este congreso. Los visitantes lo abren mediante el enlace personal de su entrada, no con el slug."],"Type":["Tipo"],"assigned (manage on product level)":["asignado (gestionar a nivel de producto)"],"Remove day":["Quitar d\u00eda"],"Save the congress first to add pages and sections.":["Guarde primero el congreso para a\u00f1adir p\u00e1ginas y seccion